# Flathub redistribution terms for NitroCam (com.azevedomedia.NitroCam)

NitroCam application code and branding remain Proprietary © Azevedo Media.

## Flatpak / Flathub redistribution grant

Azevedo Media grants Flathub and end users a royalty-free, non-exclusive right to:

1. Build, host, redistribute, and update the Flatpak package `com.azevedomedia.NitroCam`
   via Flathub (and Flathub mirrors), at no charge to end users.
2. Use the application name, icon, and screenshots solely for Flathub listing,
   store metadata, and package identification.

This grant does **not** open-source the NitroCam source code, and does not permit
rebranding or redistribution of NitroCam outside the Flatpak packaging context
without separate written permission.

Host-side components required for full functionality (`v4l2loopback`, `usbmuxd`,
`adb`) are third-party software under their own licenses and are not bundled.

Contact: https://nitrocam.app
